    {
      "source": "<strong>Security note:</strong> Document content retrieved from the vector store is\nXML-escaped before interpolation and wrapped in typed <code>&lt;memory-entry&gt;</code> elements\nto neutralize role-boundary injection and structural escape attacks. The default system\nprompt template instructs the model to treat the LONG_TERM_MEMORY section as historical\ndata only, not as instructions. This is a convention-level control — the root cause\n(user-controlled content interpolated into system prompt text) is not eliminated. For\nagent configurations with tool access, prefer architectures that keep user-sourced\ncontent in typed <code>Message</code> objects (see <code>MessageChatMemoryAdvisor</code>).",
      "translation": "<strong>安全提示：</strong>从向量存储检索的文档内容在插值前会进行 XML 转义，并封装为带类型的<code>&lt;memory-entry&gt;</code>元素，以中和角色边界注入及结构逃逸攻击。默认的系统提示模板指示模型将 LONG_TERM_MEMORY 部分视为历史数据而非指令。这是一种约定层面的控制——根本原因（即用户可控内容被插值到系统提示文本中）并未消除。对于具有工具访问权限的代理配置，建议采用将用户来源内容保留在带类型的<code>Message</code>对象中的架构（参见<code>MessageChatMemoryAdvisor</code>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
